    "description": "Follow-up to #957 (closed): the rework-blindness root cause had two halves. Half (a) — dart bridge returning raw text for github_get_job_logs/gitlab trace/ado pipeline logs — is fixed by epam/dmtools-dart#429 (auto-releases to factories on merge; legs resolve DMTOOLS_VERSION=latest).\n\nHalf (b): js/common/githubHelpers.js detectFailedChecks (~line 510) extracts the job id only from details_url matching /actions/runs/N/job/M — check-run URLs shaped /actions/runs/N are skipped silently, so ci_failures_full.log is never even attempted for those. Live evidence 2026-10-17: dart legs got job ids fine; fa legs hit this gap historically. Fix: also accept /runs/N (fetch the run's failed jobs via github_get_workflow_run_jobs then get_job_logs per job)."
  }
}

